1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:03,343
(Raj:)Oh, my God, here he comes. This is it.

2
00:00:12,195 --> 00:00:14,665
- What the hell is that thing?
- I don't know.

3
00:00:14,831 --> 00:00:16,321
(Sheldon(on screen):)This is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

4
00:00:16,499 --> 00:00:19,029
(Sheldon(on screen):)Experimental log.

5
00:00:19,202 --> 00:00:23,032
Wormhole generator, test 44.

6
00:00:23,206 --> 00:00:25,936
Wormhole-generator test?

7
00:00:30,813 --> 00:00:35,983
The first 43 parallel universes I've checked
proved to be empty.

8
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:41,022
(Sheldon:)I see no reason to suspect universe
number 44 will be any different.

9
00:00:47,196 --> 00:00:56,026
- Oh, my God!
- Holy crap!

